#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:196
msgid "Choose a public page with the following shortcode. Visitors who open the gallery archive will land on that page."
msgstr "Välj en offentlig sida med följande kortkod. Besökare som öppnar galleriarkivet hamnar på den sidan."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:204
msgid "Upload one full-size original per image. Visitors see a display copy; the original is stored privately for downloads and sales. Changes apply to images uploaded afterwards; for earlier photos, use Make new copies on a gallery’s Photos tab."
