msgstr "(ingen titel)"

#: blocks/gallery/index.js:47
msgid "Passwords, client lists, expiry dates and terms of the gallery always apply."
msgstr "Galleriets lösenord, kundlistor, slutdatum och villkor gäller alltid."

#: blocks/gallery/index.js:85
